sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant TUI as bloom-tui
    participant D as bloomd
    participant X as Transport
    participant A as Apple services

    Note over TUI,A: Outbound send

    U->>TUI: type message and press Enter
    TUI->>D: Send conversation body generation
    D->>D: persist as Queued
    D-->>TUI: MessageAccepted id
    D->>X: send conversation body
    X->>A: encrypted iMessage
    A-->>X: delivery receipt
    X-->>D: DeliveryChanged Delivered
    D-->>TUI: event delivery updated
    TUI->>U: transcript shows Delivered

    Note over TUI,A: Inbound receive

    A->>X: APS push
    X->>X: decrypt and handle
    X-->>D: Message received
    D->>D: dedupe then persist
    D-->>TUI: event Message
    TUI->>U: render in transcript

    Note over TUI,A: Session loss

    X-->>D: Session RenewalDue
    D->>D: enter Renewing state
    D-->>TUI: event Session degraded
    TUI->>U: show non-blocking warning
